{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月13日，鐵路12306宣佈正式上線國際機票業務。該服務由鐵路12306攜手廈門航空共同打造，標誌着12306平台從「國內通達」向「國際連接」邁出實質性一步。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586280.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:21:56.843127+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:57:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:15.068863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:15.068863+00:00","content_hash":"e0c365ff2ffa60c88d57953049d93b9905b73fbf596998b940552d5d6c8b0438","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}